kudu (0.5.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Recommend ca-certificates rather than depend on it: kudu starts without
    it and needs it to download cloud images.
  * Offer qemu-system-riscv rather than qemu-system-misc as the third
    emulator: kudu runs qemu-system-riscv64, which qemu-system-misc does not
    ship.
  * On arm64, prefer qemu-system-arm and depend on qemu-efi-aarch64: kudu
    refuses to start with aarch64 as its only emulator and no aarch64
    firmware.
  * Recommend qemu-efi-riscv64, which kudu needs when riscv64 is its only
    emulator.
  * Suggest tigervnc-viewer and vde2.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 05:04:47 +0100

kudu (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
  * Depend on qemu-utils, for qemu-img: kudu has always used it for disk
    images and refuses to start without it from 0.5.0.
  * Depend on e2fsprogs, for chattr on a btrfs data directory, and
    recommend xz-utils, for FreeBSD guest images.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 04:20:20 +0100

